def article(slug,title,en,desc,de,key,pairs):
 sources=[dict(label={'uni':'France Universités | manifesto, 20 October 2026','school':'French education ministry | draft budget, pages 4–7','residence':'French higher education ministry | 30 September 2026'}[key],url=U[key]),dict(label={'uni':'TF1 Info / AFP | independent reporting','school':'Localtis | budget reporting','residence':'TSA | independent interview with an immigration lawyer'}[key],url=U[key+'-second'])]
 fm=dict(layout='../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro',title=t(title,en),description=t(desc,de),date=NOW,author='LTU Global Education News 編輯部',category=t('法國教育','Education in France'),topic='france',tags=['France','2027'],**photo(key,'法國校園實景資料照，非本次事件現場','Archive photograph of a French campus, not the reported event'),sources=sources)
 path='src/pages/news/'+slug+'.md';md(path,fm,pairs,key);news.append(dict(slug=slug,title=title,url='https://globalednews.com/news/'+slug+'/',publishedPath=path,sources=sources,verifiedAt=NOW))
article('france-universities-billion-euro-appeal-2027','法國80位高教代表發表宣言：要求2027追加10億歐元','French university leaders call for an additional EUR 1 billion in 2027',
'10月20日宣言要求改善學生支持、大學運作與校舍；這是追加預算訴求，並非已獲政府核定。','An October 20 manifesto seeks more support for students, university operations and campuses. It is a funding demand, not an approved allocation.','uni',[
('80位法國大學校長及高教機構負責人10月20日透過France Universités發表宣言，要求2027年追加約10億歐元，並召開青年議題的全國討論。TF1／法新社同日報導這項呼籲。','On 20 October, 80 university and higher-education leaders issued a France Universités manifesto seeking approximately EUR 1 billion more in 2027 and a national discussion on young people’s future. TF1/AFP reported the appeal the same day.'),
('## 訴求不只針對升學平台','## Beyond the admissions platform'),
('宣言把學生經濟困境、教學研究人力及校舍更新列為重點，認為Parcoursup討論不能掩蓋大學資源問題。這是高教代表的立場；追加經費與新增名額仍須政策及預算程序，不能當成既定措施。','The leaders identify student hardship, staffing and campus renewal as priorities and argue that debate about Parcoursup should not obscure institutional resources. These are their demands: funding and capacity changes still require policy and budget decisions.'),
('## 台灣家庭如何判讀','## Reading this as a Taiwanese applicant'),
('編輯分析：選校時可把課程是否照常、學習支持與住宿安排列為查詢項目，逐校核對正式通知。全國性的追加預算呼籲，不等於每所大學停課，也不是個別申請人已獲獎學金。','Editorial analysis: check each institution’s current teaching, academic support and housing notices. A national funding appeal does not mean every university is closed or that an individual applicant has received a scholarship.')])
article('france-school-budget-2027-staffing-explainer','法國2027學校預算解析：經費增加，教師員額仍擬淨減','France’s 2027 school budget: higher spending alongside proposed teacher reductions',
'草案列不含退休金640億歐元；教師員額擬淨減1,588個全時當量，與全體人員總額是不同口徑。','The draft provides EUR 64 billion excluding pensions, while proposing a net reduction of 1,588 teacher FTEs. Total staffing uses a different scope.','school',[
('法國教育部10月1日公布2027預算草案。本篇10月21日查核其口徑：不含退休金的經費為640億歐元，以相同計算範圍較2026年增加12億歐元；Localtis的獨立報導亦列出這組數字。','France’s education ministry published its draft 2027 budget on 1 October. Checked on 21 October, it proposes EUR 64 billion excluding pensions, up EUR 1.2 billion on a comparable basis. Localtis independently reports those figures.'),
('## 經費與教師員額不能混為一談','## Spending and teacher posts are different measures'),
('官方預計2027開學學生數減少約18萬人；扣除另行配置職位後，教師員額擬淨減1,588個全時當量。另一方面，學生支持人員及受訓教師職位增加，使部會整體職位擬淨增3,257個。不能把後者寫成新增3,257名正式授課教師。','The ministry expects roughly 180,000 fewer pupils. After other allocations, teacher posts would fall by a net 1,588 FTEs. Support and trainee posts increase, producing a proposed overall gain of 3,257 positions; that is not 3,257 additional established classroom teachers.'),
('## 對中學選校的意義','## Implications for school choice'),
('這仍是預算草案，尚不能當作每所學校的最終配置。編輯建議：台灣家庭規劃赴法中學或交換時，向目標學校查課程、教師替補與學生支持；全國平均不能保證個別班級的實際條件。','This remains a draft, not a final allocation for every school. Editorial guidance: Taiwanese families considering secondary study or exchange should ask their school about courses, replacement teachers and student support. National averages do not guarantee individual classroom conditions.')])
article('france-student-residence-continuity-2026','法國擬簡化國際學生居留程序：銜接畢業與續讀，仍須確認個案','France announces measures to reduce gaps in international students’ residence status',
'9月30日宣布延伸多年度學生居留、限制額外文件與強化校內協助；公告不等於現有證件自動延期。','September measures address permit duration, document requirements and campus assistance. The announcement does not automatically extend an existing permit.','residence',[
('法國內政與高教部門9月30日宣布措施，處理學位證書晚於學年結束核發、導致續居留或轉換身分遇到困難的情況。本篇是10月21日查核的政策解析，並非今天新公布的法規。','On 30 September, France announced measures addressing gaps caused when degrees are issued after the academic year ends, complicating residence renewal or status changes. This is an explanation checked on 21 October, not a new regulation announced today.'),
('## 官方宣布哪些方向','## What was announced'),
('措施包括涵蓋修業週期、效期至取得學位當年12月31日的多年度學生居留證；續證文件限於法定清單；發展校內國際流動協助中心。官方原文表示將向地方機關發出指示，因此不宜聲稱所有證件已自動延長。','The measures envisage multi-year student permits covering the study cycle through 31 December of the graduation year, a statutory limit on renewal documents and stronger campus mobility support. The announcement says instructions will be sent to prefectures; existing permits should not be assumed to extend automatically.'),
('## 國籍與身分仍須分開查','## Check nationality and status separately'),
('TSA另訪問移民律師，指出受雙邊協定規範的阿爾及利亞學生有不同法律細節，顯示不能把一句「國際學生適用」套到所有人。台灣學生應依自己的證件、學程及地方機關書面要求辦理；這項公告也不是工作許可保證。','TSA’s separate lawyer interview highlights special rules for Algerian nationals under a bilateral agreement. Taiwanese students should check their own permit, programme and written prefecture requirements. The announcement is not a guarantee of permission to work.')])
common=[('## 台灣資格與申請','## Taiwanese eligibility and application'),('台灣籍可申請，但須為繳付國際生全額學費的新生；澳洲或紐西蘭公民、澳洲永久居民或其他永久簽證持有人不適用。已抵免超過課程總學分三分之一者不適用。隨課程入學申請審查，沒有另設獎學金申請。','Taiwanese applicants may qualify as new full-fee international students. Australian/New Zealand citizens and Australian permanent or other permanent visa holders are excluded, as are applicants with credit exceeding one third of the course. Assessment accompanies admission.'),('## 時程與續領','## Timing and continuation'),('10月21日查核開放受理，官方未列統一獎學金截止日；依課程與offer的接受、繳費期限。須維持合格全時修讀、國際生身分及GPA 4.0／7等條件；不得與政府資助或其他Flinders獎助併領。這是學費抵減，不支付生活費，方案可因入學梯次調整。','Open when checked on 21 October, with no single scholarship deadline listed; course, acceptance and payment dates apply. Maintain eligible full-time enrolment, international status and GPA 4.0/7. Government funding and other Flinders awards cannot be combined. It reduces tuition, not living costs; availability can change by intake.')]
